+config ZYNQSDR
+	tristate "Web-888 zynqsdr SDR platform driver"
+	depends on ARCH_ZYNQ
+	help
+	  Control/data driver for the Web-888 (RX-888) SDR receiver,
+	  providing the /dev/zynqsdr misc device that the RaspSDR websdr
+	  userspace talks to (RF frontend GPIO control, PE4312 attenuator
+	  bit-bang, FPGA signature/DNA queries, and the RX/waterfall/PPS
+	  DMA data plane). Clean-room re-implementation of the vendor's
+	  closed-source built-in driver against the RaspSDR/server
+	  zynq/ioctl.h ABI.
+
 endmenu
